  "description": "RACVUP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H56 F32 N16 O2 Yb4,2(C7 H8),0.5(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb2 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb1 (Yb) has 1 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 1 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.291-3.956 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.94-139.02°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(DFForm)8O2]·2PhMe·0.5thf.",
